### S3配置验证接口

POST http://localhost:8080/api/automation/v1/s3/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "bucket": "my-test-bucket",
  "path": "data/"
}

###

### 创建带S3数据源的DataFlow

POST http://localhost:8080/api/automation/v1/dataflows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "S3数据处理流程",
  "description": "从S3读取文件并处理",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "0",
      "title": "S3数据源",
      "operator": "@s3/list-objects",
      "dataSource": {
        "operator": "@s3/list-objects",
        "parameters": {
          "sources": [
            {
              "bucket": "my-data-bucket",
              "path": "input/"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1",
      "title": "处理数据",
      "operator": "@internal/python",
      "parameters": {
        "code": "# 处理S3数据\nfor item in __0['items']:\n    print(f\"Processing {item['key']}\")"
      }
    }
  ]
}

###

### 运行S3数据流

POST http://localhost:8080/api/automation/v1/dataflows/{{dataflow_id}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

###
